      "created_at": "2017-04-25T05:49:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm getting goaded into this by my own hubris + the guys on the Discord server s o</p><p>I have The Sims 3 and the following expansions:</p><ul>\n<li>Into the Future</li>\n<li>Ambitions</li>\n<li>Supernatural</li>\n<li>Seasons</li>\n<li>Generations</li>\n<li>Pets</li>\n</ul><p>I've already emulated Baron Blade in this game (spoilers: <strong>he's really successful</strong>) and I've been wondering if I should do two things; 1) simulate all of SoTM, or at the very least the characters of the base set, and 2) have a fourm of my awful adventures showing these characters.</p><p>If someone beat me to the punch I won't waste my time but if not, tell me:</p><ul>\n<li>Should I have a fourm following my adventures of simulating <em>Sentinels of the Multiverse</em> in the Sims 3?&nbsp; If so, where?</li>\n<li>Does anyone know / have good traits for the characters?</li>\n<li>And finally, who should I follow the adventures of?</li>\n</ul><p>Let me know your thoughts!</p>",
