      "raw": "<p>I&#39;m getting goaded into this by my own hubris + the guys on the Discord server s o</p><p>I have The Sims 3 and the following expansions:</p><ul><li>Into the Future</li><li>Ambitions</li><li>Supernatural</li><li>Seasons</li><li>Generations</li><li>Pets</li></ul><p>I&#39;ve already emulated Baron Blade in this game (spoilers: <strong>he&#39;s really successful</strong>) and I&#39;ve been wondering if I should do two things; 1) simulate all of SoTM, or at the very least the characters of the base set, and 2) have a fourm of my awful adventures showing these characters.</p><p>If someone beat me to the punch I won&#39;t waste my time but if not, tell me:</p><ul><li>Should I have a fourm following my adventures of simulating <em>Sentinels of the Multiverse</em> in the Sims 3?&nbsp; If so, where?</li><li>Does anyone know / have good traits for the characters?</li><li>And finally, who should I follow the adventures of?</li></ul><p>Let me know your thoughts!</p>",
